+     * <p>Android needs a notification while a download keeps running with Bare in the background:
+     * Chromium's foreground service before Android 14, the user-initiated job from Android 14 on.
+     * Without them Android stops the download. So this is the least it can show: no file name, no
+     * progress, no Live Update, and Cancel.
+     */
+    public static Notification buildQuietNotification(
+            Context context, DownloadUpdate downloadUpdate, int notificationId) {
